{"ID":"20230927152020-xgtt0x2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927152020-xgtt0x2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152020-xgtt0x2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152022-shfo3sl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152022-yeplq8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152022-shfo3sl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【散花丹】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927152022"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927152022-shfo3sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152022-shfo3sl","updated":"20230927152022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《辩证录》卷四。柴胡2钱，炒栀子5钱，白芍2两，当归1两，生地1两，熟地2两，玄参2两，天花粉3钱，陈皮1钱，茯神5钱。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152022-yeplq8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152022-yeplq8i","updated":"20230927152022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：妇人肝火炽盛，肝气郁结，而成癫症。一时发癫，全不识羞，见男子而如怡，遇女子而甚怒，往往赤身露体而不顾。"}]}]}